# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hashport — root env var map
#
# This file documents which environment variables belong to which workspace.
# Do NOT put real secrets here. Copy the workspace-local examples instead:
#
#   cp apps/frontend/.env.example apps/frontend/.env.local
#   cp apps/backend/.env.example  apps/backend/.env
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── apps/frontend (see apps/frontend/.env.example) ───────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL        Backend API base URL (e.g. http://localhost:4000)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STELLAR_NETWORK     Stellar network: testnet | mainnet
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HASHPORT_CONTRACT_ID  Deployed hashport-account contract ID (C...)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WHATSAPP_BOT_NUMBER   Bot number shown in the "chat with us" link

# ── apps/backend (see apps/backend/.env.example) ─────────────────────────────
# NODE_ENV, PORT, HOST            Server runtime
# DATABASE_URL                    Postgres connection string
# REDIS_URL                       Redis (session/state for chat conversations)
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN           Meta WhatsApp Cloud API access token
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID        WhatsApp Business phone number ID
# WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN           Webhook verification token (you choose it)
# WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET             Meta app secret (webhook signature check)
# STELLAR_NETWORK                 testnet | mainnet
# STELLAR_HORIZON_URL             Horizon endpoint
# STELLAR_RPC_URL                 Soroban RPC endpoint
# HASHPORT_CONTRACT_ID            Deployed hashport-account contract ID (C...)
# SIGNER_SECRET_KEY               Relayer/fee account secret key (S...) — never commit
# WALLET_ENCRYPTION_KEY           Key used to encrypt custodial user keys at rest

# ── contracts/hashport-account ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No runtime env vars. Deployment uses the stellar CLI's own identity/network
# config (`stellar keys`, `stellar network`).
